00:00:26.310 --> 00:00:28.080
you know, thank him, but
I never got to meet him

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:30.870
and I was in LA, I had like a meeting with

00:00:30.870 --> 00:00:33.094
a independent film
director at like Fred Segel

00:00:33.094 --> 00:00:36.810
