00:01:11.850 --> 00:01:13.230
So now whenever someone comes up to me

00:01:13.230 --> 00:01:14.670
I'm so happy to say hi to them.

00:01:14.670 --> 00:01:15.503
- Yeah.

00:01:15.503 --> 00:01:18.270
Well and especially like, he
probably would've loved that

00:01:18.270 --> 00:01:20.280
